# Files excluded from the published archive on pub.dev (but kept in git).
#
# doc/assets/ holds the animated SVG demos. They are safe to exclude because the
# README references them via absolute raw.githubusercontent.com URLs, which
# pub.dev resolves against the repository, not the archive.
#
# scripts/ holds maintainer-only tooling (demo generation).
#
# test/ is deliberately SHIPPED: for a tool that rewrites your files,
# letting users audit and run the suite matters more than the kilobytes.
doc/assets/
scripts/
